{"chunk_id": "c8d0d48cd72f", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "原料药产业动态", "date_hint": "2025年7月1日", "text": "国家医保局、国家卫生健康委印发《支持创新药高质量发展的若干措施》，其中提出，鼓励商业健康保险扩大创新药投资规模。鼓励商业健康保险公司通过创新药投资基金等多种方式，为创新药研发提供稳定的长期投资，培育支持创新药的耐心资本。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "c8d0d48cd72f", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "317a8a201bb9", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "原料药产业动态", "date_hint": "2025年1月3日", "text": "原料药是我国医药产业出口优势产品。据医保商会数据，2023年我国大宗原料药出口额居于前三的品种依次为氨基酸及其衍生物、维生素类和激素类，分别为37.9亿美元、32.7亿美元和27.5亿美元；除抗生素类原料药出口额较2022年有所增长，氨基酸及其衍生物类、维生素类原料药同比均出现下降。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "317a8a201bb9", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "08e0d0645882", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "原料药产业动态", "date_hint": "2024年10月24日", "text": "以华海药业和国药现代为代表的原料制剂一体化龙头药企，2024 年前三季度业绩均实现较高的增长，这主要受益于原料药景气度回升，以及持续降本增效，管理和制剂一体化红利兑现。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "08e0d0645882", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "a74cb1068f74", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "原料药产业动态", "date_hint": "2024年8月8日", "text": "8月7日晚，全球化工巨头巴斯夫称，受2024年7月29日发生于德国路德维希港基地一装置的火灾影响，巴斯夫欧洲公司（同时代表其受影响的关联公司）宣布，从即日起至另行通知前，部分维生素A、维生素E、类胡萝卜素产品以及部分香原料产品的供应遭遇不可抗力影响。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "a74cb1068f74", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
{"chunk_id": "c0637ddce734", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "名词解释", "date_hint": "", "text": "原料药，指用于生产各类制剂的原料药物，是制剂中的有效成份，由化学合成、植物提取或者生物技术所制备的各种用来作为药用的粉末、结晶、浸膏等，但病人无法直接服用的物质。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "c0637ddce734", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "42564e5811bb", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "原料药的主要分类", "date_hint": "", "text": "原料药主要分为大宗原料药、特色原料药、专利原料药。大宗原料药主要包括抗生素、维生素、解热镇痛类；特斯原料药主要包括降血压、降血脂、降血糖、抗血凝；专利类一般为创新药的CDOM等。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "42564e5811bb", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
